{
  "feature": "Finding the tools, PR D: Ask in the card search",
  "note": "Signed in as the audit account (decks and a collection). Same-origin dev server; flags per the account's overrides. The listbox is the one shared by D and E1's Home popover.",
  "out": "contact-sheets/tool-discovery-d",
  "clearAbout": true,
  "widths": [
    {
      "label": "phone",
      "width": 390,
